[Event "Sicilian vs 2.Bc4"]
[Opening "Sicilian: White's other tries"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 c5 2. Bc4 {The bishop aims at f7 – the most common try against your Sicilian.} e6 {Shuts the bishop's diagonal and prepares ...d5.} 3. Nf3 a6 {Makes room for ...b5 to chase the bishop.} 4. a4 d5 {Now the center: you attack the bishop and e4 at once.} 5. exd5 exd5 6. Be2 Nf6 7. O-O Be7 8. d4 O-O *

[Event "vs 1.e3"]
[Opening "Other first moves"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. e3 d5 {Take the center – White's quiet first move gives you time.} 2. d4 Nf6 3. Nf3 e6 4. Bd3 c5 {Hit the center from the side, as in your Queen's Gambit Declined.} 5. c3 Nc6 6. Nbd2 Bd6 7. O-O O-O *

[Event "vs the Colle 2.e3"]
[Opening "London & 2.Nf3"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. e3 Nf6 3. Nf3 e6 4. Bd3 c5 {The Colle system: White wants e4 later. You strike first with ...c5.} 5. c3 Nc6 6. Nbd2 Bd6 7. O-O O-O 8. dxc5 Bxc5 {Your bishop comes back with a free and active game.} *

[Event "vs 2.Nc3 3.Bf4 (Jobava)"]
[Opening "London & 2.Nf3"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Bf4 c5 {Against the Jobava London, hit d4 at once.} 4. e3 cxd4 5. exd4 a6 {Stop the knight jump Nb5 – it would threaten Nc7+, a fork of king and rook.} 6. Nf3 Nc6 7. Bd3 Bg4 {Pin the knight and develop.} *

[Event "vs 2.Nc3 3.Bg5 (Veresov)"]
[Opening "London & 2.Nf3"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Bg5 Nbd7 {Protect the knight on f6 with the other knight – no doubled pawns after Bxf6.} 4. Nf3 h6 5. Bh4 e6 6. e3 Be7 7. Bd3 c5 {The usual strike against White's center.} 8. O-O O-O *

[Event "vs the early queen 2.Qh5"]
[Opening "1.e4 e5: White's other tries"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Qh5 {The early queen: she attacks e5 and looks at f7.} Nc6 {Protect e5 with a piece that develops.} 3. Bc4 g6 {Now f7 is attacked twice – block the queen and chase her away.} 4. Qf3 Nf6 {Blocks the attack on f7 again and develops.} 5. Ne2 Bg7 6. Nbc3 d6 7. d3 O-O {You are ahead in development – her early trip cost White time.} *

[Event "vs the early queen 3.Qf3?!"]
