[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Qh5 Nc6 3. Bc4 g6 4. Qf3 Nf6 5. g4 {A trap: White wants g5 to chase your knight and then Qxf7#.} Nd4 {Counterattack! The queen and the pawn on c2 are hit.} 6. Qd1 d5 {Open the center while White's king is still in the middle.} 7. exd5 Bxg4 *

